OL,3,AFaisal Islam: This Budget was micro and
OL,4,Athat was deliberate
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was not a mini Budget, but it was
OL,7,Frather small. It might be called the
OL,8,F"micro Budget".
OL,10,FSmall does not necessarily mean bad,
OL,11,Fbut it clearly falls short of radical
OL,12,Faction to create a promised new
OL,13,Feconomic model.
OL,15,FA new "theory of growth" was not
OL,16,Funveiled as promised by the prime
OL,17,Fminister Andy Burnham.
OL,19,FIt was preamble, roadmap, consultation,
OL,20,Fperhaps the starter to the main course,
OL,21,Fwhich appears to be the PM's 10-year
OL,22,Fplan next month.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
